<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Statement I:</strong></td><td>All s-block elements are found in nature.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Statement II:</strong></td><td>The 4<em>f</em> and 5<em>f </em>series are kept below the periodic table.</td></tr></tbody></table>
